\item[S2] M. Cocos, \emph{On Polarized Pfaffians and the Euler Characteristic of Flat Affine Manifolds} (2025), arXiv:1504.04852v12, Section 1 and Remark 2.1. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1504.04852v12}.
